  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3203.29 Heat input",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.29 “Heat input” means heat derived from the combustion of fuel in a budget source and does not include the heat derived from preheated combustion air, recirculated flue gas, or exhaust from other sources.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36 (formerly Env-A 3203.30)",
